# DOUDOUVOICE AI VIDEO CREATOR — COMPLETE MULTI-MODEL CREATIVE DIRECTOR, VOICE INTEGRATION & FINAL QUALITY ASSURANCE SYSTEM

## 1. PROJECT OBJECTIVE

Upgrade the existing DoudouVoice AI Video Creator Beta into a professional, autonomous, end-to-end AI commercial video production system.

The system must combine:

- Muse Spark 1.2 Contributor for multimodal analysis, creative direction, and Editing Plan generation.
- Muse Spark 1.1 as an independent Senior Editing Director and Quality Reviewer.
- The complete existing DoudouVoice Studio voice-generation capabilities.
- The existing FFmpeg rendering infrastructure, with Modal Cloud execution when properly configured.
- Muse Spark 1.1 for final rendered-video inspection before releasing the MP4 to the user.
- Programmatic technical validation to ensure the final video is genuinely valid and matches the campaign requirements.

The intended workflow is:

**Asset Analysis → Creative Direction → Iterative Editing Plan Review → Voice Configuration → Script & TTS → FFmpeg/Modal Rendering → Final AI Inspection → Repair if Necessary → Final Video Release.**

The goal is not simply to generate a video. The goal is to produce a professional commercial advertisement that follows the user's campaign requirements and passes both creative and technical quality checks.

